  (text "MOUNTING" (at 151.76 294.21999999999997 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 1656a506-e214-5ba0-a70c-36a809baf3e8)
  )
  (text "NOTES\n1. Pololu DRV8874 carrier pin ORDER is a placeholder (names are correct). Fix design.CARRIER_ROWS and regenerate.\n2. DB50 pinout from SCORBOT-ER 4u User Manual ch. 8 (same as ER III Table D-1). Pins 37-44 unused, 22 = gripper switch (no connection in arm).\n3. 74HC14 symbol is used for the 74LVC14 (same pinout). Powered from +3V3; inputs are 5 V tolerant.\n4. Carrier current limit with SLEEP at 3.3 V is about 2.9 A (VREF pulled to SLEEP by 10k on the carrier, CS has 2.49k). R21-R26 (DNP) lower it.\n5. ADS7828 uses its internal 2.5 V reference: CS reads 1.12 V/A, so readings clip above about 2.2 A."
    (at 15 389.79999999999995 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left))
    (uuid 250bb167-1ef7-5896-b824-b70394173c81)
  )

